WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.220
SCP-049 Vs SCP-106.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:08.420
Will the classy, intellectual Plague Doctor
with a deadly touch finally be able to defeat

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.240
the ruthless, calculating Old Man with an
unstoppable fetish for pain?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.390
Let’s find out.

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:18.410
Both have deadly anomalous abilities concerning
touch - the Plague Doctor stops hearts, and

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:19.830
the Old Man melts flesh.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.960
However, it’s unlikely that either would
be as effective in combating each other as

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.350
they would against non-anomalous humans.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.980
But it’s in the other anomalous effects
that a clear winner comes through.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:36.260
While SCP-049 can create an army of zombies,
numbers mean nothing in SCP-106’s pocket

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:41.780
dimension, so if ever the fight was taken
there, we think 106 would have a clear advantage.

